msgctxt "#30136"
msgid "Overclock or downclock the Super Accelerator 1 (SA-1) chip. Setting this value above 100% may improve performance in games that support the SA-1 chip. Use with caution, as it may also cause some games to crash or exhibit other issues."
msgstr "对超级加速器 1 (SA-1) 芯片进行超频或降频。将此值设置为高于 100% 可能会提升支持 SA-1 芯片的游戏性能。请谨慎使用，因为它也可能导致某些游戏崩溃或出现其他问题。"

msgctxt "#30137"
msgid "Overclock or downclock the SuperFX coprocessor. Setting this value above 100% may improve performance in games that support the SuperFX. Use with caution, as it may also cause some games to crash or exhibit other issues."
